{"title":"What Jill Knows","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">Jill Appleseed doesn&#39;t think the bandits taking exactly enough not to be noticed is luck. She thinks it&#39;s bookkeeping, and she wants the book.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/jill-appleseed\">Jill Appleseed</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"jill-appleseed\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>17</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/bandit-tally-book\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/a4076cb7ec0ed13633d5.svg\" alt=\"\">Bandit Tally Book</a> <b>×1</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/jill-appleseed\">Jill Appleseed</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Havenheim)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"jill-appleseed\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Get into the bandit camp&#39;s main hall <span class=\"muted\">inside <a href=\"#\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"place\" data-map-id=\"Bandit Cave\">Bandit Cave</a></span></li><li value=\"3\">Take the tally book from a brigand and bring it to Jill - <a href=\"#/item/bandit-tally-book\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/a4076cb7ec0ed13633d5.svg\" alt=\"\">Bandit Tally Book</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 439, 157</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"439|157|Take the tally book from a brigand and bring it to Jill\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"4\">Give Jill Appleseed your answer <span class=\"muted\">at 439, 148</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"439|148|Give Jill Appleseed your answer\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>360</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>16,200</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Jill Appleseed says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Jill Appleseed:</b> It&#39;s out of my hands now.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Jill Appleseed:</b> That&#39;s what I wanted, and it still sits badly.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Jill Appleseed:</b> Three weeks that book was under the floor of the press house. Every day I did nothing with it, I was deciding something.</p><p class=\"q-you\"><b>You:</b> You decided today.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Jill Appleseed:</b> I did. Whatever happens next down in that cave, it starts here.</p></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>What Jill Knows</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-what-jill-knows\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-what-jill-knows\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-what-jill-knows\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-what-jill-knows\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-longmeadow-what-jill-knows\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Jill Appleseed says</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}